ZdbR60F4yiw0G84kprEU9rL9XLYmOyV.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_ExSkill_Level_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"狙いは正確……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/M2bi3GWqPm2bvRdtWPlriPjbbEjcRPnR.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_ExWeapon_Get.ogg","category":"growup","text":"こういう所に来ても、先生は変わらないね。いつも支援…いや、助けてくれて、ありがとう。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/aK0IBqf56Fve2OAtX71NgxRfAF38ss61.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_Formation_In_1.ogg","category":"formation","text":"なんど、ここに釣りの道具が…","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/Zo1w1kQSFKYG6t23ppHHkPQ26zc2B5Jr.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_Formation_In_2.ogg","category":"formation","text":"ん、準備完了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/N8i9lK6h2gGeXzhvfcffDQ3GRIp2Q3rB.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_Gachaget.ogg","category":"growup","text":"釣りの時間だよ、先生。行こう。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/wljep8mNEazoHQo4lF6ys4F2ZIzPxJ1q.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_Growup_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"釣りは道具が命。ありがとう、先生。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/fiMiKorEDspEst7YjNPF30aOXmXmzD1v.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_Growup_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"これなら、もっと大きいのが釣れるかも。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/kC50BGcNdPaOh1Upx5SK9H2rM1cOORjP.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_Growup_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"お返しに、大物を釣ってくるね。期待してて。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/ZFlH6MGzeaugl0ArXacNvckDkFLTw6vl.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_Growup_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"よし、今すぐ出発しよう。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CGRJswX3oaOnOvcKvvQLJx8JTWKau0Tr.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_Lobby_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"そう何度もあるチャンスじゃないから、出来る事は最大限やってみる。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/OS2rjtm0DHeE6kimEXGy7EI7rL8ndAkn.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_Lobby_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"先生、何かしたい事ある？どこに行って、何したい、それどもお腹空いた？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/huVJ4O49w3qbGBQYTYtMAov6D6dvsZQd.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_Lobby_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"これ、先生のために着てる。ん、大物とってくるから、期待してて。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CLG7LivWPmF9yYeH0EmmvYG9L6ZOytQq.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_Lobby_4.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"エアコンや扇風機もいいけど、水中の方が好きかも。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/TgL2C3PXGMi0WuxDrqBZ9udeK2B6VgPh.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_Lobby_5.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"そう言えば、先生は泳げる？教えようか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/rTpki4q2rhrZZPcBBYBlFLuS1GqztZhD.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_LogIn_1_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"お帰り、先生。今来たばっかの人にかける言葉じゃないかもしれないけど…","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/1RlsZoQCBofsXjTilyjybQTXqbEZl38Q.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_LogIn_1_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"外、出ようか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CWwyUhihu57XQWcuOkKKrJ8u3ZzmhhMR.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_LogIn_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"待てたよ、先生。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/vUMzl0bmIYyvpOYaMCd29mLTbCCO7Vop.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_MemorialLobby_1_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"ただいま、先生。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/78deDwkBJS2NaZCgxwVVeagT9YdtpQp2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_MemorialLobby_1_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"ん、成功した、これで作れるよ。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/sJzuJsKU3XqKtvfFPYwoNSqJDYn3Qu4p.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_MemorialLobby_2_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"パンフレットで見た、あの料理。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/MLkPr1dpqaFPXpZzVOUyPdzcIWl8EmnI.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_MemorialLobby_2_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"料理道具も準備したから、問題ない。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jxOqWLUDxB23gaYXFcQuMLPWcIgZFezH.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_MemorialLobby_3_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"先生が一緒に来てくれてよっかた","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/Q9cJ6tKE5aR1QQOZg54hFVEow6EC06Ze.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_MemorialLobby_3_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"一人だったら、途中でやめてたかもしれない。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/bNZMwSYxJ8kKRs1OvIxxssms1Xl1DyIW.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_MemorialLobby_4_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"…そんなことない、今も、これを考えるようになったきっかけも…","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/lKTWkCX30CeXvdEosD4YJ94NVh1wDeUP.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_MemorialLobby_4_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"すべて、先生がいてくれだから。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/Ze3tu0vtSGAMoLEbesjZH28ZctLzavF0.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_MemorialLobby_5_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"先生、","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/9VwRyjvDS0PbSmN45mZbMfrnuyky9EFV.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_MemorialLobby_5_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"ありがとう。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/P3Mmv0U6sRIvg0ncMi8JnN4pe865p88Q.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_Relationship_Up_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"またこんな…いや、ありがとう、先生。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/BeW8aCUpA5QvGMK0QRbLA4y42aeoOEPb.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_Relationship_Up_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"ありがとう、先生。ところで、食べたい海産物とか、ある？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/mGNZfjcd6kKSt6MWI0SVjmJZjDPer9gY.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_Relationship_Up_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"先生のためなら、何でもとってくるよ。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/S5oN8VTagm0XoEsU3QmwDcgdqOvcNsTN.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_Relationship_Up_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"楽しいかって？うん、すごく。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/wzSDp8BxdL4z6VAa3KnxXiU4MoqydLi4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_Season_Birthday.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"あ、誕生日、おぼえてくれたんだ、ありがとう、先生。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/D3FuVsOxOY0vV21SGQlvIx6NltW35Xvl.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_Season_Birthday_Player.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"お誕生日おめでとう、先生。 誕生日のご馳走… お刺身でいい？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/WvWLH4mu06w9uEArOwHCMbSqYLR5d9Rh.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_Season_Halloween.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"ハロウィーン…カボチャを被った人を見たよ。私も被ってみようかな…","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/YA9D7JcScMoZvNRnNibDMseJ9o0aRtIp.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_Season_NewYear.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"新年…だね。明けましておめでとう、先生。ん、新年も一緒に色んな所行こう。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/gVpGPTVyY7liBZvI0y1kIRQYki3vstL3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_Season_Xmas.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"クリスマス…か。水中の方が暖か…くはない、やっぱり無理か…","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/eAjs8cYuHuY1ELSP2NOIeY1xUsSlQX4T.ogg"},{"description":"CH0188_Title.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"ブルーアーカイブ。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/bhS4ckF41B2Djji0OJvKzl3ImEg01zgr.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"ch0188_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"在这里…… 应该钓不到鱼。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"那是什么……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"要是有 钓鱼塘的话……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"……咦， 能钓到吗。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"……嗯？ 刚才的声音是……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"嗯，这个不需要。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_commonskill.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"嗯……嗯！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_exskill_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"......！来了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_exskill_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"就是现在！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_exskill_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"是条大鱼！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_exskill_level_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"你跑不掉的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_exskill_level_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"目标正确。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_exskill_level_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"就算来到了这里…… 老师也一点没变呢。谢谢你一直支援…… 啊不对，是帮助我。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_exweapon_get.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"啊，正好这里有钓具。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_formation_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"嗯，准备就绪。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_formation_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"\"钓鱼时间到了， 老师，走吧。\"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"来钓鱼的话，工具是最重要的。谢谢老师。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"有了这个，说不定能钓到更大的……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"作为回报，我会给老师钓一条大家伙，尽管期待吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"好，马上出发吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"只要做得到， 就尽量去尝试吧。因为机会并不会一直都有。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_lobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"老师，有什么事情想做吗？要不要去什么地方？ 肚子饿了吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_lobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"这身衣服 是为了老师而穿的。嗯，我会抓个大家伙回来的， 拭目以待吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_lobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"空调和风扇也不错……但在水里更舒服。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_lobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"对了老师，你会游泳吗？ 要不要我教你？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_lobby_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_login_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师，你来啦。虽然你才刚来， 这样说好像不太合适……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_login_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_login_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"……要不要去外面？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_login_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"我一直在等你呢，老师。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_login_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"……我回来了，老师。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_memoriallobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"……嗯，成功了。 可以用这个做了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_memoriallobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"宣传册上看到的，那道菜。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_memoriallobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"做菜的工具也都备好了， 没问题的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_memoriallobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_memoriallobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"……还好有老师 陪我一起来。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_memoriallobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_memoriallobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"如果只有我自己， 可能早就半途而废了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_memoriallobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_memoriallobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"不……不是这样的。 不管是现在， 还是让我变得能这样想，","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_memoriallobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_memoriallobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"都是因为…… 有老师在我身边。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_memoriallobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_memoriallobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"……老师。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_memoriallobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_memoriallobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"……谢谢你。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_memoriallobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"老师总是这样......没什么，谢谢老师。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_relationship_up_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"谢谢你，老师。对了，你有什么想吃的海鲜吗?","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_relationship_up_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"只要老师想吃，我什么都能钓回来。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_relationship_up_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"我开不开心？嗯，很开心啊。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_relationship_up_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_season_birthday","category":"lobby","text":"啊，生日……老师还记得啊，谢谢你。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_season_birthday.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_season_birthday_player","category":"lobby","text":"生日快乐，老师。生日宴上……要不就吃生鱼片吧？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_season_birthday_player.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"新春快乐，老师。 听说有句话叫年年有鱼， 我们也快去钓鱼吧。 ……什么？不是这个鱼？ 不要在意细节。今天我一定要 钓到条大家伙给老师看看。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_season_chinesenewyear.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_season_halloween","category":"lobby","text":"万圣节…… 我看到有人戴着南瓜头套。……我也戴戴看吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_season_halloween.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_season_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"海上的月光真美。 老师，我们来比赛游泳吧， 向着月亮的方向，谁游得更远就 算胜利。放心，如果老师累了， 我会背你回来的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_season_midautumn.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_season_newyear","category":"lobby","text":"新年……到了。新年快乐，老师。嗯，新的一年也要一起去很多地方。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_season_newyear.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_season_xmas","category":"lobby","text":"毕竟是……圣诞节嘛。说不定水里反而更暖和…… 呃，好像并没有。……看来这样还是太勉强了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_season_xmas.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_title","category":"lobby","text":"Blue Archive.","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/cn/ch0188_title.ogg"}],"voice_kr":[{"description":"CH0188_Title","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0188_Title.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/ch0188_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/ch0188_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0188_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A0%82%E7%8B%BC%20%E7%99%BD%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/c